'''Hunter's Map I''' (狩人の地図Ⅰ, ''Karyūdo no Chizu Ⅰ'', '''Hunter's Map Ⅰ''') is an [[Enigma Stages|Enigma]] map that drops [[Catfruit|Behemoth Stones]]. It has two stages and upon clearing either of them, the map disappears until it is found again. It can only appear at Enigma Levels 1-3; once Level 4 is reached, it is permanently replaced by [[Hunter's Map II]]. It was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]].

